# conftest.py runs every test in its own temporary directory, so output files
# (orca.*, finalsystem.*, trajectories, ...) should never land here. This
# whitelist keeps any leftovers from a crashed or manual run out of git status.
#
# Every data directory must be listed below. A directory left out is ignored in
# silence: orca_outputs/ was missing here, so `git add` skipped it, it never
# reached a commit, and the 13 tests that read it broke as soon as the untracked
# local copy was cleaned away. Add new data directories here in the same commit.
*
!.gitignore
!conftest.py
!test_*.py
!extra_files/
!extra_files/**
!orca_outputs/
!orca_outputs/**
!pdbfiles/
!pdbfiles/**
!xyzfiles/
!xyzfiles/**
